    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "Hogs lead the board lower",
        "body": "- December hogs settled Wednesday at **$58.60**, down 5.5% from Tuesday's $62.025 settle, the largest move on the board.\n- Live cattle settled at $227.375, down 1.1%, and feeders at $351.425, down 0.4%.\n- Drovers' Profit Tracker says packer profits fell while feedlot losses moderated.",
